SUMMARY:RIVERDALE ART WALK - June 6 & 7
DESCRIPTION:Toronto’s premier outdoor juried art fair returns on June 6th & 7th\, showcasing more than 165 fine artists in Jimmie Simpson Park. Presented by the Artists’ Network\, this two-day public exhibition showcasing only fine art\, now in its 28th year\, features a diverse range of established & emerging artists selected through a jury process. Our diverse community includes painters\, sculptors\, photographers\, & more\, all showcasing their unique perspectives & creative expressions. The event is free to the public & provides an opportunity for art lovers & the community to connect directly with the artists\, fostering a vibrant exchange of ideas & creativity in a dynamic outdoor setting. Jimmie Simpson Park: 872 Queen Street East\, Toronto. Hours: Saturday: 11am-6pm and Sunday: 10am-5pm. Find us at: https://www.instagram.com/riverdaleartwalk
URL:https://nowtoronto.com/event/riverdale-art-walk-june-6-7/
LOCATION:Jimmie Simpson Park\, Jimmie Simpson Park\, 872 Queen St E\, Toronto\, ON M4M 1H9\, Canada\, Old Toronto\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M4M 1H9
CATEGORIES:Art & Design,Community Events,Exhibitions,Outdoor
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://nowtoronto.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/riverdale-art-walk-june-6-7.png
END:VEVENT
