SUMMARY:Beaver Tails & Butter Tarts True Canadian Desserts
DESCRIPTION:Get ready to celebrate the best of Canadian baking! In this hands-on\, 2.5-hour class\, Chef Stephanie will guide you through two beloved Canadian classics — the iconic butter tart and the irresistible Beaver Tail — from scratch to finished treat. \nWhat You’ll Make: \nYou’ll start by crafting a buttery\, flaky tart dough from scratch\, letting it chill to perfection while you whip up a rich\, gooey filling. Then it’s time to assemble and bake your tarts to golden perfection — and yes\, you’ll be taking 6 or 12 freshly baked butter tarts home with you! \nWhile your tarts are in the oven\, Chef Stephanie will show you how to shape and fry BeaverTails — that famous Canadian fried dough pastry — using a pre-prepped dough. You’ll then get creative decorating them with your favourite toppings and enjoy them warm\, right in class. \nYou’ll Learn: \n\nHow to make a classic butter tart pastry dough & filling\nProper tart assembly and baking techniques\nHow to shape\, fry\, and decorate BeaverTails like a pro\n\nWhat’s Included: \nAll ingredients and equipmentExpert instruction from Chef Stephanie6 or 12 butter tarts to take homeGreat memories and full bellies! \nThis class is perfect for home bakers\, food lovers\, and anyone proud to fly the maple leaf. No experience necessary — just bring your appetite and your Canadian spirit! 🍁
URL:https://nowtoronto.com/event/beaver-tails-butter-tarts-true-canadian-desserts/
LOCATION:12 Sousa Mendes Street\, 12 Sousa Mendes St\, Toronto\, ON M6P 0A8\, Canada\, Old Toronto\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M6P 0A8
CATEGORIES:Classes & Workshops,Food & Drink
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://nowtoronto.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/beaver-tails-butter-tarts-true-canadian-desserts.png
END:VEVENT
