SUMMARY:Soccer & Spice Food Tour by Tasty Tours
DESCRIPTION:Soccer & Spice Food Tour by Tasty Tours \nOn this guided food tour\, taste and savour how popular soccer nations cheer\, celebrate and fuel that game-day energy. Taking place in Kensington Market\, tour takers will experience the buzz of the vibrant multicultural neighbourhood as they move from shop to shop\, with each bite transporting them to another stadium\, team\, and dish. With hand-picked stops at the best local eateries\, skip the line access and insider stories\, guests will get to travel the soccer world through their tastebuds\, wander one of Toronto’s most unique districts\, and discover fun international tidbits about the beautiful game. \nJune 6 through July 19\, Saturdays and Sundays at 2.30 p.m.
URL:https://nowtoronto.com/event/soccer-spice-food-tour-by-tasty-tours/
LOCATION:160 Baldwin Street\, 160 Baldwin St\, Toronto\, ON M5T 3K7\, Canada\, Old Toronto\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M5T 3K7
CATEGORIES:Food & Drink,Toronto26 (Soccer Celebration),Tours
