UID:10401212-1780756200-1784482200@nowtoronto.com
SUMMARY:Soccer & Spice Food Tour
DESCRIPTION:Kick off World Cup season the Toronto way – by eating your way through our global food scene. On this limited-time food tour with insider tastes and tales\, you’ll taste how popular soccer nations cheer\, celebrate and fuel game-day energy. \nStep into Kensington Market and experience the buzz of Toronto’s famously multicultural neighbourhood – music spilling out of cafés\, the smell of fresh tortillas and spicy sizzling meat\, vibrant graffiti murals stretching along the streets. As you move from shop to shop\, each bite transports you to another stadium\, team\, and dish. One moment you’re tucking into the controversial classic from host country Canada\, the next you’re tasting the herby brightness behind fan-favourite Italy’s match-day food. \nWith hand-picked stops at the neighbourhood’s best local eateries\, you’ll skip the lines\, savour insider stories\, and uncover how immigrant communities shaped Kensington Market. By the end\, you’ll have travelled the world through your tastebuds\, wandered one of Toronto’s most unique districts\, and discovered flavours you won’t find on any other food tour. Gooooal!
