SUMMARY:Yonge Cafe Patio Sessions
DESCRIPTION:Escape the daily grind and settle into Willowdale’s ultimate open-air retreat\, where the city’s best soundtrack meets the summer breeze. Every week\, the Yonge Cafe patio transforms into a vibrant live music oasis\, featuring a revolving door of GTA talent that refuses to be boxed into a single genre. \nWhether you’re looking to belt out high-energy Top 40 and rock anthems\, groove to soulful R&B and funk\, or hear your favorite pop hits reimagined through a smoky jazz and blues lens\, we’ve got your vibe covered. We pride ourselves on the “best of both worlds” approach\, pairing those essential\, foot-stomping covers with fresh original sets from emerging GTA artists – giving you a front-row seat to the next big “Toronto Sound.” \nLIVE on the Yonge Cafe & Bistro “NORTH YORK Blvd PATIO” Saturday nights: 7pm – 9pm in JUNE and JULY 2026 \nPlease check @willowdaleartscollective on Instagram for possible last minute scheduling updates\, rain delays\, last minute cancellations and/or artist substitutions.
URL:https://nowtoronto.com/event/yonge-cafe-patio-sessions/
LOCATION:Yonge Cafe and Bistro\, 5000 Yonge St #105\, North York\, ON M2N 0A7\, Canada\, North York\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M2N 0A7
CATEGORIES:Live Music
