SUMMARY:F1inTO Monaco Grand Prix Watch Party. Toronto's Biggest F1 Party
DESCRIPTION:GET TICKETS HERE: https://monacogp.eventbrite.ca \nThe Monaco Grand Prix\, Formula 1’s crown jewel. The tight streets of Monte Carlo\, the yachts in the harbour\, the casino lights\, and zero room for mistakes make this the most glamorous and unforgiving weekend on the calendar. \nJoin us for the ultimate Monaco Grand Prix Watch Party as F1’s best drivers dance millimetres from the barriers through one of the most iconic circuits in motorsport. Expect strategy chaos\, champagne energy\, and a race where legends are made. \nFast cars. Big drama. Monaco magic. Don’t watch it alone. \nFirst 50 tickets are $2 ex-tax with promo code F1INTOMONACO (max 3 per person). After that\, $6 ex-tax. $8 at the door if anything is left. \nReserve early. \nWhat to expect on race day: \n\nBig screen race broadcast with full-room audio\nPrize drops and giveaways at the chequered flag\nSeated and standing areas\nRace-day atmosphere from lights out to the last lap\n\nThe run-down: \nDoors open at 8:00 AM ET. Lights out is 9:00 AM ET. Come\, hang out and get pumped up for the race. \nThis is a reservation event. Book your seat in advance and check in at the door. Groups of up to 10 can be booked in a single reservation. Seating is allocated on a first-come\, first-seated basis after check-in. \nThis room will sell. Book early. \nDate: Sunday\, June 7th\, 2026 Venue: The Loose Moose\, 146 Front St W\, Toronto\, ON Doors: 8:00 AM ET Lights out: 9:00 AM ET \nF1inTO is an independent\, fan-led event. Not affiliated with Formula 1\, the FIA\, or any Formula 1 team or rights holder.
URL:https://nowtoronto.com/event/f1into-monaco-grand-prix-watch-party-torontos-biggest-f1-party/
LOCATION:Loose Moose / Antler Room\, 146 Front St W\, Toronto\, ON M5J 1G2\, Canada\, Old Toronto\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M5J 1G2
CATEGORIES:Sports
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://nowtoronto.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/f1into-monaco-grand-prix-watch-party-torontos-biggest-f1-party.png
END:VEVENT
