SUMMARY:The Eglinton Way Farmer's Market
DESCRIPTION:The 9th Annual Eglinton Way BIAFarmers’ Market Season Opens June 7th!\nSince 2018\, our market has become a staple weekly event dedicated to strengthening and promoting our community\, supporting local farms and businesses\, and enhancing food security. Find everything from local vendors and live music to fresh goods\, handmade crafts\, free kids activities and more! The market takes place every Sunday from June to October in the Green P parking lot on Burnaby Boulevard\, just north of Eglinton near Castle Knock Road. Our event runs every Sunday from June 7th to October 25th.
