SUMMARY:Breathtaking Gardens at Casa Loma
DESCRIPTION:Just in time for summer\, Casa Loma is transforming the castle into Breathtaking Gardens\, a new Sunday morning wellness series running June 7 through August 30\, 2026. \nPresented in partnership with Soul Expansion\, the 13-week series invites guests to recharge through immersive live-music sessions led by Freddy Gervasi and The Band of Souls\, along with local wellness instructors who guide yoga\, Pilates\, and somatic movement. \nSet against Casa Loma’s lush summer gardens\, the series offers a restorative start to the week in one of the city’s most iconic settings\, with each session designed to calm the mind and support the body’s natural flow.
